        "description": "Joshua Rogers discovered that Privoxy incorrectly handled memory allocation. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2021-44540)  Artem Ivanov discovered that Privoxy incorrectly handled input validations. An  attacker could possibly use this issue to perform cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks.  (CVE-2021-44543)",
